<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Manila's Vending Machine</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f4f4f4;
    }
    header {
      background-color: #ff4c4c;
      color: white;
      padding: 2rem;
      text-align: center;
    }
    nav {
      background-color: #333;
      color: white;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 2rem;
      padding: 1rem 0;
    }
    nav a {
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    .hero {
      background-image: url('https://source.unsplash.com/1600x600/?vending-machine');
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: center;
      color: white;
      padding: 5rem 2rem;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .section {
      padding: 3rem 2rem;
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: auto;
    }
    .products, .contact {
      display: grid;
      gap: 2rem;
    }
    footer {
      background-color: #222;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 1rem;
      margin-top: 3rem;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>Manila's Vending Machine</h1>
    <p>Your snacks and drinks, anytime, anywhere!</p>
  </header>

  <nav>
    <a href="#about">About</a>
    <a href="#products">Products</a>
    <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
  </nav>

  <div class="hero">
    <h2>Always Open, Always Fresh</h2>
    <p>Grab your favorite snack 24/7</p>
  </div>

  <section id="about" class="section">
    <h2>About Us</h2>
    <p>Manila's Vending Machine is a proudly local business offering convenient access to snacks, drinks, and essentials. Our machines are placed strategically across Manila to serve students, professionals, and late-night snackers.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="products" class="section products">
    <h2>Our Products</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Cold Drinks (Soda, Water, Juices)</li>
      <li>Chips and Crackers</li>
      <li>Cookies and Chocolates</li>
      <li>Cup Noodles and Ready-to-Eat Meals</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section id="contact" class="section contact">
    <h2>Contact Us</h2>
    <p>Email: manilasvending@gmail.com</p>
    <p>Instagram: @manilasvending</p>
    <p>Location: Available in schools and offices across Manila</p>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <p>&copy; 2025 Manila's Vending Machine. All rights reserved.</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>


